+private extension View {
+  /// DEX-85: keep the caller's label as the whole trigger on Mac Catalyst.
+  ///
+  /// Under the Mac idiom (`TARGETED_DEVICE_FAMILY` includes 6, i.e. "Optimize
+  /// Interface for Mac"), SwiftUI resolves `Menu` to an AppKit-style pull-down:
+  /// bordered chrome, a disclosure chevron, and its own intrinsic sizing. That
+  /// replaces a custom label — Dexter's circular status glyph vanishes behind a
+  /// wide bordered pill, which shifts the whole task row.
+  ///
+  /// `.menuStyle(.button)` + `.buttonStyle(.plain)` is the non-deprecated
+  /// spelling of the old `.borderlessButton` style, and `.menuIndicator(.hidden)`
